[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * no `NULL` check — **no function takes a pointer**, so no null-pointer input is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   representable across the FFI boundary;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * no explicit range check, no min/max constant, no clamping;
